{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/30/8376934/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんもうお昼ご飯は食べたかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"27日はベストアーティスト見てくれましたか〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は、ガールズルールを披露しました(＾ｰ^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのガルル衣装でワクワク。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛は毛先だけ軽く巻いてもらいました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/30/8376934/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんのポーズやら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"48グループさん達もいてドキドキ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NMBの吉田朱里ちゃんが声をかけてくださって一緒に写真を撮りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色白で細くて可愛い♡♡♡\n私も大好きですーーー(〃▽〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお話できたらいいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベストアーティストまた来年も出られるように、頑張ろっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は、サマンサタバサDELUXE 表参道店へお邪魔してクリスマスイベに出演してきました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し早い、サンタさんに変身。☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/30/8376934/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店はキラキラしてて、宝石箱の中に入ってる感じでした^_−☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、寒い中たくさんの方が来て頂き本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のクリスマスは、サマンサティアラで素敵な日を過ごして下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで皆さんにご報告。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、乃木坂46白石麻衣、最近アレを買いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、アレですアレ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそうそうそうそう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今みんなが持ってる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/30/8376934/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3DS(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全にメンバーとメイクさん達の影響です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか白石がゲームをやるなんて思わなかったでしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だが、買ってしまいました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カセット？何をやってるかって？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはまだ秘密にしとこうかな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ一言。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ難しい((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b